          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The recipe requires: 300 g cream cheese, 125 mL thickened cream.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p24-q7-stem-packs",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 1,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Cream cheese only comes in 250 g packs so he bought 2 packs: 500 grams of cream cheese.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p24-q7-stem-misconception",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 1,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mr Ding thought “If I’m increasing the amount of cream cheese by 200 g, then I should increase the amount of thickened cream by 200 mL, so I need 325 mL”",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p24-q7-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Describe what would happen to his cheesecake if he did this.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p24-q7-a-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "He is less-than-doubling the cream cheese but more-than-doubling the cream. It would be too runny.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "The cream cheese is multiplied by $\\frac{500}{300}=\\frac{5}{3}$, while the cream is multiplied by $\\frac{325}{125}=\\frac{13}{5}$. The cream has increased by a greater factor, so there is too much cream relative to the cheese. The cheesecake would be too runny.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p24-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p24-q7-root-bank-2e62e4c7-11f6-44a2-bcf4-d82c48f1d9f5",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "left",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 0,
              "lineHeight": 1.3199970000068182,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "How much thickened cream should he use for 500 g of cream cheese? ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Give your answer to 2 decimal places.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p24-q7-b-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "208.33\\text{ mL}",
                    "display": false
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Let $x$ be the amount of thickened cream in mL.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{300\\text{ g cheese}}{125\\text{ mL cream}}&=\\frac{500\\text{ g cheese}}{x\\text{ mL cream}}\\end{align*}$$\nTake the reciprocal of both sides.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{125\\text{ mL cream}}{300\\text{ g cheese}}&=\\frac{x\\text{ mL cream}}{500\\text{ g cheese}}\\\\x&=\\frac{125\\times500}{300}\\\\x&=\\frac{625}{3}\\\\x&\\approx208.33\\end{align*}$$\nHe should use approximately $208.33\\text{ mL}$ of thickened cream.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      }
    ]
